{"c":[{"id":"0ac61137cde78f4e","sum":"Ask scope is Jev's per-field scope ask (asks/not/unclear, 2 wordings, SCOPE_CUTOFF); code only vetoes, never hand-written reading rules (A2's 12 rounds failed). After rewording, recalibrate with scripts/ask-scope-eval.ts (--answers rescores free).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T094325Z-2ecfd9f27d40a67e","text":"Ask scope is Jev's per-field scope ask (asks/not/unclear, two wordings, SCOPE_CUTOFF); code only vetoes. Answer a widening finding with a veto or 'unclear', never a hand-written reading rule: A2's twelve rounds of those never converged.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T094325Z-46934d63d09e671d","text":"Recalibrate SCOPE_CUTOFF after changing the scope ask's wording: scripts/ask-scope-eval.ts scores Jev's answers against scripts/ask-scope-labels.json; --answers rescores a saved run for free.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"b8239301d4a3ddf5","sum":"I2-I3: $0 Ask replays need CARET_JEV_CACHE_MODE=replay, no CARET_ENV_FILE and a nonzero --spend-limit; any resolver date assumption (reference year, format order, century) goes to the verifier with Provenance.says, never a raw span.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261007T103113Z-2eca6bf2c96e40c9","text":"Ask evals: realfill-asks --spend-limit 0 refuses replayed requests too; for a $0 replay set CARET_JEV_CACHE_MODE=replay, unset CARET_ENV_FILE and pass a nonzero --spend-limit (misses fail as jevFailed).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T113449Z-ded1f2a70adbf732","text":"fill dates: any resolver assumption (year from a reference, order from a format/locale, century) sends the value to the verifier with Provenance.says; send-line years and stated-format orders are offered as their own candidates; a raw span never takes them.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
